# Skills Matrix

This repository demonstrates competencies across IT service management, network operations, and cybersecurity incident response.

## Technical Skills

| Domain | Skills Demonstrated |
|---|---|
| Network Operations | Circuit outage triage, device reachability checks, carrier escalation, monitoring interpretation |
| ITSM / ITIL 4 | Incident lifecycle, prioritization, SLA/OLA concepts, problem and change linkage |
| Incident Response | NIST-aligned detection, analysis, containment/recovery, and post-incident review |
| Documentation | Clear ticket chronology, runbooks, policies, templates, and case studies |
| Communication | Professional customer and carrier updates in English and Spanish |

